{
    "id":  11066,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "RF Remote Control for LED Single Color / CCT 4 Zones",
    "reference":  "92057-FUT007",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \"Mi-Light\" remote control allows you to easily adjust the intensity and color temperature of your lights, from warm white to cool, in up to 4 different zones. Customize the lighting to your taste by creating combinations and groups as needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a fast communication speed and an advanced anti-interference system, you\u0027ll enjoy smooth, uninterrupted control. Its 30-meter range ensures wide coverage in spacious areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequires 2 AAA batteries (not included).\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eRF Remote Control for LED Single Color / CCT 4 Zones\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the wireless remote control \u003cstrong\u003eMi-Light - Mi Boxer\u003c/strong\u003e, your perfect ally for controlling home or office lighting. With its 2.4GHz RF receiver, this remote transmits signal up to 30 meters, even through walls and ceilings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasily adjust \u003cstrong\u003eintensity\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003ecolor temperature\u003c/strong\u003e, from warm white to cool white. Intuitive design with dedicated on/off buttons and central panel for personalizing brightness and tone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eControl up to \u003cstrong\u003efour different zones\u003c/strong\u003e of lighting with a single remote. Note: independent zone control requires additional controllers.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake smart lighting easy and efficient!\u003c/p\u003e",
